==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] (800%) spawn, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*4 [[Teacher A]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.07~40 seconds<sup>2f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Master A.|Master As]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] (800%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] (1,200%) spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
**2 [[Teacher A]]s spawn, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start by saving money, send [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to keep the Teacher A.s and Master A.s at bay. When they are defeated, spawn Ururun or an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] with decent range and get ready for the boss wave.

After you hit the base, the main threats are the Shadow Boxer Ks as their high DPS can shred through your frontline. Their main weakness is their high knockback count so a constant stream of Paris Cats can continuously knock them back until they eventually die. The rest is much easier, even THE SLOTH, since it's slow movement speed and attack rate allows it to be easily stalled.

